<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post7570461305992287187..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: The Bubble of U.S.-Israeli Dominance </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>21</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8471052518609502632</id><published>2009-02-01T21:37:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-01T21:37:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous 5:49 PM wrote:Palestinians, Jews and Ame...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous 5:49 PM wrote:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Palestinians, Jews and Americans need to collectively unite against the Elite forces of evil that wish their demise.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;To which WNG responded:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Boy, this earns an emphatic &quot;Amen!&quot; from me.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I agree. Indeed, what is needed&lt;BR/&gt;is not so much unity but rejection&lt;BR/&gt;by each of the gangsters in their&lt;BR/&gt;respective areas. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Tzi Freedman on chabad.org&lt;BR/&gt;wrote recently&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I believe that we have a responsibility towards the people living in Gaza. They are an oppressed people whose right to go about living normal, healthy lives has been stolen from them by a ruthless pack of gangsters.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The true terrorists are the leaders of Syria and Iran, as well as their hired thugs in Arab lands. If not for them, the people of Gaza could have long ago been leading a peaceful, thriving existence. These brutal criminals massacre their own people willingly, for nothing more than singing at a wedding party or for daring to oppose their policies. They stockpile their weapons in mosques and schools and fire from densely populated areas.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;He goes on to point out that the&lt;BR/&gt;2005 withdrawal from Gaza has led&lt;BR/&gt;to this debacle, just as many said&lt;BR/&gt;it would:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Truthfully, the Israeli government is also to blame. Rather than concerning itself with the welfare of the Arab population living in Gaza and the West Bank, their only concern was self-defense and world opinion. If they truly cared in a really humanitarian way about these people, they would not suffice with providing hundreds of millions of dollars of food, electricity and medicine, but would also have done all possible to stomp out the foreign-based thugs long ago--along with providing a proper, moral education for youth. If we had kept a presence in Gaza, as dangerous as that was, it would have saved over a thousand Arab lives. We are too quick to find the fast and easy solutions to peace, rather than to take the harder, longer yet proven road.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;That&#39;s the end of my quotation&lt;BR/&gt;from Tzi Freeman&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Another reporter on the Israeli&lt;BR/&gt;scene might be known to some &lt;BR/&gt;readers here. from Barry Chamish whose  reporting on the Rabin assassination coverup appeared&lt;BR/&gt;in The New American in the 1990s:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;BC: &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Such a waste of lives, property and dignity, just to pave the way for the next and bigger waste of lives, property and dignity over Gaza.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Condeleeza Rice forced a ceasefire down Israel&#39;s throat, co-signed by Germany, Italy, Spain, France, Britain and the EU...the usual gang of warmongers. This, as the IDF was poised to rid the world of Hamas and bring in Fatah to rule Gaza. It&#39;s heads or tails anyway you look at it. But for this fight, Israel had the quiet, jubilant backing of Egypt, Fatah and the ruling establishment of much of the Arab world. It won&#39;t ever be this good diplomatically again. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Knowing that the government was about to betray the south of the country, and its bravest soldiers who saw comrades fall for nothing, as usual, an atrocity was launched to immediately change public opinion. In the spirit of the shadow government&#39;s slaughter of Arabs in 1994 to push along the withdrawal from Hebron, another Arab was chosen as the object of the Israeli people&#39;s instinctive pity. A Gazan surgeon who works in Israel, Dr.Izzeldin Abublaish, had his home targeted by an Israeli tank, losing three daughters, and the hideous scene was reported seconds later by the grieving, shocked doctor by cellphone to TV Channel Ten&#39;s reporter Shlomi Eldar. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And if you think this ghastly massacre wasn&#39;t planned, then you don&#39;t know the psychological warfare the Israeli government and media play with the people. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Now with Israel pulling out, Hamas will tell its people they won. And God save anyone who disagrees.The little bully Hamas will shout that Israel cheated. They played dirty. And the mean old Americans backed them up, thus, we stood up to the greatest fighters on earth. Therefore, we are the bravest of them all. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;But bigmouth Hamas knows he was overpowered and he&#39;s already preparing to bring bigger kids with him next time. But first, a little body-building course is called for. And someday the pipsqueak boaster is going to grow up and he&#39;s going to be bigger than Israel. And Israel will regret not finishing him off when they had their chance. But Israel chickened out and it will eventually pay for it. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;For now, Israel is going to learn that mass destruction isn&#39;t winning. That 1400 enemy bodies isn&#39;t winning. Only victory is winning. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;This is in stark contrast to the war I [Chamish] fought in, the Lebanon War of 1982. Then, the government stated the war&#39;s goal was to remove the PLO from the region. To do so, at great cost, it entered Beirut and surrounded the PLO&#39;s neighborhoods. It took almost two months but the PLO were forced onto ships out of Lebanon. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;To prevent loss of life, the IDF showered a targeted neighborhood with leaflets offering a choice; the PLO surrenders within 24 hours and comes out with its arms in the air, or your neighborhood will be destroyed, including, if need be, by carpet bombing. Innocents were told where to gather safely. It was up to the PLO to save the neighborhood by complying with Israel&#39;s terms. There was no room for negotiation. It was unconditional surrender or continuing war. It was a nasty strategy interspersed with utilities cutoffs and the like, but this was a war of survival and Israel won it. And if Israelis with a different agenda hadn&#39;t shoved the Oslo war accord down the country&#39;s throat a decade later, this latest bloodbath would never have occurred. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In this invasion Israel should have offered as a first condition; bring us Gilad Shalit, or more likely, his remains, to our lines within 24 hours or face our wrath. That is war with a purpose. The only purpose of the latest invasion was to prepare for the next one. And I have a fair idea when it will come. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Few bothered to notice, but in the twenty days of the Gazan operation, it only rained once, and barely. By joining Jordan and the PA with Israel&#39;s water grid in the name of peace, the Kinneret and the artesian wells which served Israel well for 60+ years, in drought and plenty, are all but used up. Come summer, the next fight will be over a glass of water. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;from: ISRAEL LOSES and How It Could Have Been Different &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;This might be at http://www.barrychamish.com now &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;End BC quote.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;See his other columns and Rabbi&lt;BR/&gt;Martin Antelman&#39;s book To Eliminate&lt;BR/&gt;The Opiate for more background on&lt;BR/&gt;the Leftists in charge of the Israeli government, and Ben Hecht&#39;s&lt;BR/&gt;Perfidy and E. Black&#39;s The Transfer&lt;BR/&gt;Agreement on their policies during&lt;BR/&gt;the Holocaust. These books antedate&lt;BR/&gt;the current Gaza situation by many&lt;BR/&gt;years, though, and I do not know&lt;BR/&gt;of any others adequately treating&lt;BR/&gt;that situation.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;All the best, cycjec.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/8471052518609502632'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/8471052518609502632'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1233549420000#c8471052518609502632' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 1, 2009 at 9:37 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5492126311705563450</id><published>2009-01-17T00:11:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-17T00:11:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Oregonian aghast... Have been listening and readin...</title><content type='html'>Oregonian aghast... &lt;BR/&gt;Have been listening and reading your stuff for months. As a &quot;Bible&quot; believer, it&#39;s hard to believe, in my elementary small mind, that this Israeli/Palestinian fight is a &quot;planned in advance event&quot;.  The quote: &quot;I am an agnostic regarding the claim that the State of Israel, as it presently exists, is the fulfillment of the pious desires of ancient prophets and martyrs. But I am convinced to the point of moral certainty that Israel has no legitimate claim on our tax dollars or military aid, and that Washington’s subsidy of Israel has been an unalloyed disaster for both Israel and the region. How in the world do I in good conscience &#39;pray blessings&#39; for Israel knowing this?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/5492126311705563450'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/5492126311705563450'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1232176260000#c5492126311705563450' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 17, 2009 at 12:11 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4831997434704393098</id><published>2009-01-12T18:57:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-12T18:57:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>On the subject of Jewish war ethics, there was an ...</title><content type='html'>On the subject of Jewish war ethics, there was an article in the Jerusalem Post from May 30/31 of 2007 that supports the views I espoused earlier (read it at &lt;B&gt;www.jpost.com/servlet/Satellite?cid=1180527966693&amp;amp;pagename=JPost%2FJPArticle%2FShowFull)&lt;/B&gt;.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The comments that follow originated in a letter that former Sephardi chief rabbi Mordechai Eliyahu wrote to Prime Minister Ehud Olmert. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;According to Jewish war ethics, an entire city holds collective responsibility for the immoral behavior of individuals. In Gaza, the entire populace is responsible because they do nothing to stop the firing of Kassam rockets.&quot; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Eliyahu&#39;s son, Shmuel Eliyahu, who is chief rabbi of Safed, said his father opposed a ground troop incursion into Gaza that would endanger IDF soldiers. Rather, he advocated carpet bombing the general area from which the Kassams were launched, regardless of the price in Palestinian life.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;If they don&#39;t stop after we kill 100, then we must kill a thousand,&quot; said Shmuel Eliyahu. &quot;And if they do not stop after 1,000 then we must kill 10,000. If they still don&#39;t stop we must kill 100,000, even a million. Whatever it takes to make them stop.&quot; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Indeed the god of Judaism is Satan.  And the state of Israel is a satanic state.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Because it needs to be said, Jews are not and never have been a distinct race.  In the Old Testament they were an ethnic group in the same sense that Southerners constitute an ethnic group (ethnic group, not racial group).  Even by the standards of the War for Southern Independence, Southerners were comprised of whites, blacks, American Indians and Latinos.  All four racial groups were represented among those who fought the North.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The Jews from their earliest days were comprised of the children of Abraham, Egyptians, the slaves of Egyptians who were not Egyptians, and people from the races that comprised the Promise Land such as Rahab (the prostitute from Jericho and one of the ancestors of Christ) and Uriah the Hittite.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;If you look at Persian Jews, Ashkenazic Jews, Sephardic Jews, and white-bread, American Jews like Alicia Silverstone or Larry David, it is obvious that we are not talking about one, homogeneous race.  Jews only constitute a race when it is convenient for the ADL or some similar body to yell &quot;Anti-Semite.&quot;  The Semitic people themselves are comprised of Assryrians, Arabs, and some Jews, so the term &quot;anti-semite&quot; as commonly employed is grossly inaccurate.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;A Jew is someone who is a product of the religion and/or culture of Judaism.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/4831997434704393098'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/4831997434704393098'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231811820000#c4831997434704393098' title=''/><author><name>J.R. Rothdoony</name><uri>http://www.statelesschristianity.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 12, 2009 at 6:57 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1254257673955016465</id><published>2009-01-11T14:34:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-11T14:34:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Lemuel Gulliver 11:05 AM:I looked at the link http...</title><content type='html'>Lemuel Gulliver 11:05 AM:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I looked at the link http://www.khazaria.com/.  I did not find: &quot;Most of the world does not know that the Ashkenazic Jews originated, not in the Middle East, but in Eastern Europe, when the king of the Khazarian tribes converted to Judaism along with his people around 800 AD. They were a red-haired, watery-eyed Turkic-Mongol race renowned for their aggressiveness, warmongering, avarice, cruelty, lying, stealing, and plundering. They were feared and hated by everyone with whom they interacted.&quot; Where in this site can I find the information that you quoted?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;mongol Doc Ellis 124</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/1254257673955016465'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/1254257673955016465'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231709640000#c1254257673955016465' title=''/><author><name>Doc Ellis</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08543939658083915285</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='30' height='32' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_1kwNGyaGlXM/SJS8lW2chPI/AAAAAAAAACM/qg-P4Z07IBI/S220/Doc+166+x+177.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1989478426"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 11, 2009 at 2:34 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7576260640205916679</id><published>2009-01-09T11:58:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-09T11:58:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Arab Palestinian Christians and Arab Palestinian M...</title><content type='html'>&lt;I&gt;Arab Palestinian Christians and Arab Palestinian Muslims lived side by side for the past 1400 years, and for anybody to say that the Arab Palestinian Christians have been persecuted recently by Muslims is absolutely another big lie, like the big lie that spoke of Weapons of Mass Destruction in Iraq.&lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;--Riah Abu El-Assal, Christian Bishop of Jerusalem&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;This article by Mr Grigg is very informative. This demonstrates a profound knowledge of the situation.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The most ominous fact in the continuing genocide against the original inhabitants of Palestine is that the American people only get ONE SIDE. Also that the world stands by and allows this to happen should trouble any decent person.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I wonder if all those older ladies who give monies to Pat Robertson and Hagee and those types, if they saw the series of photos that I saw the other day from GETTY of a little boy with his dying mother on the streets of Gaza. She holds his hand and then in the next photo life is ebbing from her. The last photo she is dead and this boy of perhaps 8, is holding his head in tears.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Arabs are, of course, SEMITES, yet the Zionists have robbed the Arab of even his humanity, you see ONLY a Jew is a victim of &quot;anti-semitism&quot;, truly that is a remarkable achievement by that community to dispossess a people not just LITERALLY of their land but of their very ethnicity.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;God gives signs, to a people who are too consumed with materialism and with foolishness and who lose the awe of God they miss such signs.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Some may disregard what was a sign others will at least ponder it and wonder...&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In 1982 Israel invaded and bombed Lebanon.&lt;BR/&gt;Over 20,000 civilians were killed by Israel in that invasion.&lt;BR/&gt;One of the &quot;heroes&quot;, as the New York Times and the Washington Post profiled him, of that bombing over helpless civilians was &lt;B&gt;Ilan Ramon&lt;/B&gt; a colonel in the Israeli air force. There were no antiaircraft positions, the round-the-clock bombings were unopposed in the skies. This is what makes for a HERO in the eyes of the owners of the Times and the Post.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Who paid for those planes? Who paid for and made those bombs?&lt;BR/&gt;Who paid for the fuel? Who pays NOW for the armaments used upon the helpless innocents of Gaza?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;It is the American taxpayers. Journalist Robert Fisk in Lebanon took a piece of a missile fired by an Israeli Apache helicopter that had been shot on a RED CROSS Ambulance. The pilot had used the CROSS on the top of the vehicle as his sighting in point.  The salvaged part of the missile was clearly stamped Made in USA MacDonnel-Douglas, in Alabama. When Fisk visited the designer of bomb said, &quot;don&#39;t ask me anything about Israel, I will lose my job&quot;, interesting. LITERALLY made in the USA.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In the invasion and bombing of Lebanon in 2006 Bush expedited the supplying of CLUSTER and so-called smart bombs to Israel so they could continue their savagery on the infrastructure and civilians of Lebanon.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;When there was a UN Truce and the Israelis were leaving they dropped over ONE MILLION CLUSTER BOMBS on their way out.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;For what reason I ask you?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Vengeance is mine, saith the Lord.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/7576260640205916679'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/7576260640205916679'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231527480000#c7576260640205916679' title=''/><author><name>5-Pillar Scribe</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 9, 2009 at 11:58 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4912460628783722827</id><published>2009-01-09T06:23:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-09T06:23:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Dear Mr. Grigg,Regarding my statements about the P...</title><content type='html'>Dear Mr. Grigg,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Regarding my statements about the Polish Jews who had fled into Germany: At this YouTube link:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8DayKPRAaho&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;you will hear the hour-long video testimony of Peter Feigl, an Austrian Jew who as a child of 10-13 during the war was hidden by Christians, and thus survived the Holocaust. (He was an only child. His parents did not survive.) From about 2.5 minutes until 3.5 minutes into the narrative, he recalls that (the third reason why) his father was not concerned about the repressive laws being passed by the Nazis was because he felt that perhaps they applied only to the &quot;Polish Jews who had immigrated into Germany&quot; and who, as he puts it, &quot;refused to integrate into German society.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;There you have it from the horse&#39;s mouth. Mr. Feigl does NOT call them &quot;Galizianer Judenschwein,&quot; but if you watch his face closely you can detect, even after 50 years, a slight expression of distaste flit over his face. Some of your readers may have thought I made that up, since it is not generally talked about.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Regarding Konzentrations-Lager Neuengamme, The Wikipedia article on it states that it was liberated on 4th to 5th May 1945. The article also says, however, (Paragraph 2) that &quot;Several original buildings of the camp continued to serve as a prison (for example Building Number 9).&quot; Below in the article, under the header &quot;Memorial,&quot; it states that &quot;The KZ-Gedenkstätte Neuengamme (Neuengamme memorial site) is located at Jean-Dolidier-Weg 75 in Hamburg-Bergedorf.....In 1989 the Hamburg Senate decided that the prisons erected in 1950 and 1970 on the camp site should be relocated.&quot; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;It does not mention that its continued use as a prison under the American Occupation Authority was to imprison Polish and other displaced foreign Jews prior to their deportation by ship from the Hamburg port to Israel. It also omits to mention that the 1950 construction was again under the American Occupation Authority, to expand the holding facilities for eventual resettlement of Jews to Israel.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;This was not an act of cruelty by the Americans, but of necessity. The Polish Jews could not or would not assimilate into German society, and could not be sent back to Poland because it had been demonstrated that most returning Jews were being murdered by the Poles.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Sometimes one can only find tiny scraps of evidence, like these above, to support historical truth which has been suppressed or denied. This is just like the Holocaust itself, where there is very little physical evidence, (thus prompting the claims of deniers,) except for the testimonials of thousands of survivors who lost their entire extended families. One wonders how many families perished in toto, with no survivors to declare that they had lost three, or five, or a dozen relatives, who all vanished without a trace. There are also testimonials of  survivors who arrived at Auschwitz rail station together with their extended families, all of whom were never seen again after that moment. The survivors went right and lived, the others went left and vanished for ever. I believe those stories. At the age of over 60 I believe I can tell real tears from fake ones, and I see many real tears on those faces, even after the passage of so many years.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Yes, deniers will point to the German Nazi movies of happy well-fed inmates in swimming pools and camp libraries, and in camp orchestras and theaters, as evidence that these were jolly holiday camps, but I think that today in 2009 we are all too aware of the effectiveness of misleading government propaganda. Those movies do not impress me.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I have nothing against Jews as Jews. Most of them are delightful people. However, there is a tenet of Judaism, that Jews are special people because of their being &quot;chosen by G-d,&quot; which is over-emphasized by some groups to justify an attitude of superiority and arrogance, and a belief that all crimes against the rest of humanity are justified because Jews are &quot;special&quot; human beings.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;THAT is the attitude or tenet of their faith which has brought this unfortunate race so much grief through the past 3,000 years.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I pray thst this attitude may change before tragedy happens again, to the shame of all humanity.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Yours sincerely,&lt;BR/&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/4912460628783722827'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/4912460628783722827'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231507380000#c4912460628783722827' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 9, 2009 at 6:23 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8409194996162401704</id><published>2009-01-08T20:18:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-08T20:18:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Dan of Jerusalem,Regarding point #3&quot;Their plan is ...</title><content type='html'>Dan of Jerusalem,&lt;BR/&gt;Regarding point #3&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Their plan is to divide the world into regions which then can be merged into a world government.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;That is precisely their plan as even announced by Zbigniew Brzezinski in unequivocal terms back in 1995 at Gorbachev&#39;s State of the World Forum, &quot;Toward A New Civilization&quot;.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I find it interesting that both the Tanakh and the New Testament contain prophecies regarding a future world government divided into ten regions (Daniel 7:23-25, Revelation 17:12-13).&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;They may look like this:&lt;BR/&gt;1) Russian Union/C.I.S. - 1991&lt;BR/&gt;2) European Union - 1994&lt;BR/&gt;3) African Union - 2002&lt;BR/&gt;4) Mediterranean Union - 2013?    &lt;BR/&gt;   MEFTA (Middle East Free Trade&lt;BR/&gt;   Area)- announced by President &lt;BR/&gt;   Bush via a Whitehouse press &lt;BR/&gt;   release on June 9th, 2004&lt;BR/&gt;5) North American Union - 2013?&lt;BR/&gt;   &quot;Building A North American &lt;BR/&gt;   Community&quot; - Council on Foreign &lt;BR/&gt;   Relations Press, May, 2005;&lt;BR/&gt;   &quot;Toward A North American &lt;BR/&gt;   Community&quot; - Peterson Institute,&lt;BR/&gt;   August, 2001 by Robert Pastor;&lt;BR/&gt;   &quot;The Case For The Amero: The &lt;BR/&gt;   Economics And Politics Of A &lt;BR/&gt;   North American Union&quot; - Fraser &lt;BR/&gt;   Institute, 1999 by Herbert &lt;BR/&gt;   Grubel.&lt;BR/&gt;6) South American Union - 2013?&lt;BR/&gt;   &quot;South American Leaders Discuss&lt;BR/&gt;   Creating Continental Union&quot; - &lt;BR/&gt;   FOX News/AP, December 10th, 2006&lt;BR/&gt;7) East Asian Union - 2018?&lt;BR/&gt;   &quot;Thinking The Unthinkable, A &lt;BR/&gt;   Confucian Union&quot; - &quot;....by &lt;BR/&gt;   about 2020, the East Asian Union&lt;BR/&gt;   will be the world&#39;s most &lt;BR/&gt;   powerful bloc,...&quot; - Asia Times,&lt;BR/&gt;   April 7th, 2005&lt;BR/&gt;8) Central Asian Union - 2015?&lt;BR/&gt;   &quot;Kurultai Participants Back&lt;BR/&gt;   Kazakh President&#39;s Idea To &lt;BR/&gt;   Create The Central Asian Union&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;   - Kazinform News, September 20th&lt;BR/&gt;   ,2006&lt;BR/&gt;9) South Asian Union - 2015?&lt;BR/&gt;   &quot;South Asian Economic Union - A&lt;BR/&gt;   Growing Reality That Can Change&lt;BR/&gt;   The World&quot; - India Daily, &lt;BR/&gt;   February 12th, 2005&lt;BR/&gt;10) Asian Pacific Union - 2015?&lt;BR/&gt;   &quot;Push For Union With New &lt;BR/&gt;   Zealand&quot; - Sydney Morning &lt;BR/&gt;   Herald, December 5th, 2006&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;(The Khazarian &quot;conversion&quot; was short lived. The majority of the converts were drawn from the Khazarian aristocracy whose new &quot;Jewish&quot; identity lasted only a generation. Many of these Khazarian converts emigrated to Spain to find acceptance with the Sephardic Jewish community but were largely mistrusted and were not allowed to assimilate into their community. They eventually assimilated into the dominant Gentile cultures whether Muslim or Christian.)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/8409194996162401704'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/8409194996162401704'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231471080000#c8409194996162401704' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 8, 2009 at 8:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5908445531353417768</id><published>2009-01-08T00:53:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-08T00:53:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>A few responses to Gulliver&amp;#39;s comments, but fi...</title><content type='html'>A few responses to Gulliver&amp;#39;s comments, but first a question to Mr. Grigg.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The power elite want to bring down the US -- that&amp;#39;s why they sent US industry to China -- so why do you call it a &amp;quot;bubble of US dominance&amp;quot; ?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I would call it &amp;quot;planned war of attrition to bring about world government in the middle east&amp;quot; similar to the war in Iraq.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;1) Ashkenazi Jews are not descended from the Khazars.  They came to Eastern Europe from Western Europe after the crusades, persecution and expulsions. &lt;BR/&gt;That is why they spoke Yiddish, a germanic language.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;2) The Bolshevik revolution was funded by Rockefeller and J. P. Morgan, see Anthony Sutton&amp;#39;s book, &amp;quot;Wall St. and the Bolshevik Revolution.&amp;quot;&lt;BR/&gt;There were non-Jews and Jews involved in the revolution.&lt;BR/&gt;Many of the Jews participated in the revolution to throw off the yoke of the Czar, not realizing that the communist regime would be even worse.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Why did Rockefeller and Morgan support the communist revolution ?&lt;BR/&gt;To have the &amp;quot;best enemy money can buy&amp;quot; because you need to have an enemy for Americans to give up their rights.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;3) What do you mean by &amp;quot;The Jews&amp;quot; ? &lt;BR/&gt;Yes, some &amp;quot;Jews&amp;quot; are owners of banks, as are protestants, and Catholics.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Note: the Rothschilds have intermarried for a hundred years and are no longer Jewish.&lt;BR/&gt;  &lt;BR/&gt;The Jews involved in policy such as some of the neo-cons and some in finance such as Bernanke, are &amp;quot;court-Jews,&amp;quot; i.e. technocrats who serve the elite who hate Judaism, and oppose an independent sovereign Israel.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;These elite, which includes Jews and non-Jews, want a conflict, which Israel is not allowed to win, to bring about a &amp;quot;new middle east,&amp;quot; a soviet union of the middle east.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Their plan is to divide the world into regions which then can be merged into a world government.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Those calling for world gov&amp;#39;t hate the settlers of Judea &amp;amp; Samaria and plan to expel them.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;4) The Sephardi Jews are actually much more right-wing than the Ashkenazi Jews.  They lived among the Arabs and are suspicious of them.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;5) The Right in Israel is suspicious of this conflict, that it is a &amp;quot;war to elect Livni.&amp;quot;&lt;BR/&gt;By the right, I do not mean Netanyahu because he is not really right-wing, but like John McCain, is part of the &amp;quot;controlled opposition&amp;quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Dan&lt;BR/&gt;Jerusalem</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/5908445531353417768'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/5908445531353417768'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231401180000#c5908445531353417768' title=''/><author><name>דן</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01727936251574093248</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-922373818"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 8, 2009 at 12:53 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1436306974579551440</id><published>2009-01-07T22:41:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-07T22:41:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>LG: &quot;For example, the Grand Canyon. [...] Creation...</title><content type='html'>LG: &quot;For example, the Grand Canyon. [...] Creationists maintain God made it in six days.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Or, rather, Creationists believe  catastrophic geological processes, caused by the global flood (i.e. the flood of Noah), formed the Grand Canyon.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/328691