Europe for Jews, who had immigrated there in 1492 when Queen Isabella threw all the Jews out of Spain. In the 19th Century Bismarck got laws passed, the first such in Europe, which specifically forbade any discrimination against German Jews.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;A very different situation obtained in Orthodox Christian Russia. The Russian aristocracy hated Jews, regarding them as vermin, and the Cossacks slaughtered them regularly, especially under the last Czar Nicholas II, a weak and easily influenced man. In 1905 his secret police produced and circulated the spurious book &quot;The Protocols of the Elders of Zion.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The Bolshevik Revolution and its aftermath was the Jews&#39; revenge. Czar Nicholas II, titular head of the Russian Orthodox Church, and his entire family were shot by Jews, on the orders of other Jews, and some two-thirds of all the commissars and officials in the early Soviet Union were Jews. Hence the 70-year suppression of Christianity in Russia by the Jews, the murder of tens of thousands of priests and nuns, and the turning of thousands of churches into stables and barns. Meanwhile, anti-Semitism was a capital crime in Russia.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Soon after the end of WWI, the Jews, with a vision of a Worker&#39;s State across the world, according to the vision of the Jew Karl Marx, (in which they would at last be the rulers,) began to agitate in all countries of Europe and in America for the spread of Communism. This was the era of the General Strike in Britain, labor wars in America, and the rise of trade unions everywhere, mostly under Jewish leadership, waving their holy book, Marx&#39;s &quot;Das Kapital.&quot; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Poland was the country with the largest percentage of Jews, and the Polish Jews agitated and encouraged newly heathen Russia to invade Christian Poland in 1920.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Initially, Russia met with great success, and reached the gates of Warsaw in August 1920. All of Europe expected Poland to collapse and become Communist, but at the Battle of Warsaw in 1920 General Pilsudski pulled a hat trick and decisively defeated the Russians, who left Poland and went back home.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;As a consequence of the Jews&#39; treachery, they were driven by the hundreds of thousands out of Poland, and into Germany, where they found welcoming laws. However, the Polish Jews were not the Spanish-origin dark-haired and enormously cultured Sephardic Jews who had lived in Germany for 450 years. Racially, they were Khazars, Ashkenazic Jews from Central Russia, a vile, arrogant, thieveing, aggressive, nasty, violent, corrupt, ugly race of pale-faced, red-haired, watery-eyed Mongol-Turkic vermin. The Jews of Germany were horrified and repelled by them, and they were generally known by their German co-religionists as &quot;Galizianer Judenschwein,&quot; or &quot;Galician Jew-pigs.&quot; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The Poles too, hated them with a passion. It is not generally known that after WWII, when the Polish Jews who had fled to Germany tried to return to Poland, they were slaughtered in their thousands by the Catholic Poles. The last anti-Jewish pogroms in Europen history were in Poland in 1946. Today, there are far more Jews in Germany and Austria than in Poland. Imagine that.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Between 1920 and 1933 when Hitler seized power, the Khazarian Polish Jews managed to make themselves so universally despised in Germany by their vicious and vile behavior that it was an easy matter for Hitler to rouse the German people against ALL Jews.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In 1933, Samuel Untermayer, head of the World Jewish Congress, left New York for a meeting of the WJC in Amsterdam. He announced to the press that when he returned, he would make a statement to the press, of the political position of the Jews of the world.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;When he returned, the press was waiting in force on the docks in New York for his statement, which was carried in banner headlines around the world the next day: &quot;JUDEA DECLARES WAR ON GERMANY.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Remember, this was 1933. A boycott of German goods was decared in America, and all stores and shops were obliged to dump all their German goods. A woman found one pair of German socks in Macy&#39;s, and Jews picketed on Fifth Avenue, and declared a boycott of Macy&#39;s until it apologized and pledged to be more careful not to sell German goods.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;This was a devastating economic blow to Germany, just emerging from the Depression and hyperinflation, caused by the ruinous war reparations imposed upon it at Versailles*. In spite of this, within four years Germany had seen an economic miracle, with full employment and a booming economy, while England and America remained mired in the Depression until WWII rescued them.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;* [It is most interesting that of all the ruling heads of state in Europe in 1914, it was Kaiser Wilhelm II who pleaded and begged most vehemently for reason, and the avoidance of war. I have seen in person the very telegram Wilhelm sent to his cousin Czar Nicholas II of Russia, begging him as a dear brother to please stand down the Russian armies from the borders of Germany, or war would become inevitable. One month earlier his other cousin, King George V of England, had visited Germany on a state visit, and been received with all pomp and circumstance. Yet it was the Germans who were accused of starting World War I, and punished for it - something they did not do. It was a Serb, a Russian Orthodox assassin, backed by factions in Russia, France and Britain, who assassinated the Austrian heir apparent in Sarajevo and set the ball rolling.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Moreover, WWI would have ended in a stalemate, with a negotiated peace, and WWII and the Holocaust would never have happened, except that the Zionists wanted the British to defeat the Turks and hand Palestine, a Turkish province, over to them for a homeland. In exchange, the Jews promised to entice America into the war on the side of Britain, and the British agreed to the deal, sealing the fate of Germany.]&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In spite of this treachery of the Jews towards the one country in Europe that had treated them most kindly, prior to WWII, all the Nazis wanted was to get the Jews to leave Germany. They set up farms to teach them agriculture in the hopes they would emigrate to Palestine. There is a photo on the wall of the Holocaust Museum in Washington of a trainload of happy, waving young Jews going off to the countryside to learn farming.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Once the war began, emigration of the Jews became practically impossible, and Germany was faced with millions of people who, in 1933, had decared an all-out war on Germany. What was to be done with these self-declared traitors living everywhere in the midst of the population, in an environment of total war? How many were spies for Russia, as they had been in Poland in 1920? How many were spies for America, where the World Jewish Congress was now headquartered? How many were saboteurs? How do you tell a loyal German Jew or any other European Jew from a traitor? You cannot.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;As the bombs began to fall on German cities, (a policy BEGUN by Churchill, not by Hitler, who merely retaliated in kind, somewhat ineffectively - 60,000 British civilians died in German bombing in WWII, vs. some three million German civilians,) what was to be done with the Jews?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The answer was simple. Forcibly deport them from Germany. Then what? How do you feed and house and clothe these millions of people displaced to camps hundreds of miles away, with firebombs raining down on German cities, and millions of Germans being incinerated alive? (More in Hamburg, more in Dresden, more in Berlin, more in Frankfurt, more in Cologne, more in Stuttgart, than in either Hiroshima or Nagasaki.)&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;There was not enough food for Germans. How was Germany to feed millions of Jews in the camps? A sizable percentage of the (alleged) six million simply starved to death, or died of disease, in conditions of atrocious overcrowding. And hundreds of thousands or millions of others were, I personally am convinced, murdered, to make room for new arrivals in the limited space available for them.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And there you have it. The Jews brought the Holocaust upon themselves by their behavior, mainly the behavior of the Khazarian Ashkenazim who poured into Germany from Poland, following their abortive attempt to enslave the Christan Poles, as they had enslaved the Christian Russians.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;It is not generally known that the American Occupation authorities after WWII in Germany found the liberated Khazarian Ashkenazim Jews to be so noxious, so criminally inclined, so violent, and such a disruption to law and order that they rounded them up by the thousands and imprisoned them in the Nazi concentration camp KL-Neuengamme, located in Hamburg, prior to forcibly deporting them from Hamburg on ships headed for Palestine. This is absolutely true: Americans sent Jews BACK to the concentration camp - AFTER having won the war. The actions of war-ravaged Germany in 1942 and 1943, in light of that action by the conquerors, no longer appear so extreme, do they now? Once in Palestine, of course, the Khazars took control, and now rule that shitty little country.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Another interesting tale is that of the SS Patria, a ship illegally carrying 257 Jewish refugees from Germany to Palestine in November 1940, memorialized in the movie &quot;Exodus.&quot; It was intercepted by the British outside Haifa, taken into custody, and then sent back out to sea. It blew up in the Mediterranean on November 25, 1940, killing every soul on board, and the Jews hailed it as a mass suicide of brave Jews refusing to be sent back to Germany. It was not. Ten years later there was a ceremony to remember the heroes of the Patria, at which it was revealed the ship was blown up by the Irgun, the Jewish terror organization, after which Hamas is modeled. The intent was to blow the ship up in port in Haifa, so that the British would be forced to let the passengers disembark, but unfortunately, the British sent the ship away too soon, and it blew up at sea, killing all on board. The head of the Irgun and planner of the operation was Menachem Begin, later elected Prime Minister of Israel. No doubt, the Israeli Jews who elected him to office were not aware they were electing a mass murderer, with the blood of hundreds of Jews on his hands.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;That was not Begin&#39;s only atrocity. The Irgun also blew up the King David Hotel in Jerusalem, killing 86 people, among them 14 Jews. A horrifying chronicle of Jewish terrorism in Palestine in 1937-1948 and its thousands of hapless civilian victims may be found here:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.thewebfairy.com/nerdcities/Palestine/jewish-terrorism.htm&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Notable examples:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;April 9, 1948: A combined force of Irgun Zvai Leumi and the Stern Gang, supported by the Palmach forces, captured the Arab village of Deir Yassin and killed more than 200 unarmed civilians, including countless women and children. Older men and young women were captured and paraded in chains in the Jewish Quarter of Jerusalem; 20 of the hostages were then shot in the quarry of Gevaat Shaul. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The FIRST act of air piracy in the history of civil aviation was carried out by Israel, in December 1954, when a civilian Syrian airliner was forced down in Tel Aviv and its passengers and crew held for days, despite international condemnation.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The FIRST deliberate shooting down a civilian airliner was carried out by Israel, when a Libyan airliner was shot down by Israeli jet fighters over Sinai, in February 1973, on the direct orders of Israeli Prime Minister Golda Meir, killing all 107 of its passengers and the entire French crew. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The 15 million or so Jews of the world are storing up for themselves a vast fund of hatred among the world&#39;s 1.5 billion Muslims, not to mention the world&#39;s 2 billion Christians. Are they REALLY so arrogant as to believe that for the next 1,000 years the Jews will be able to continue their persecution, domination, exploitation, murder, corruption and bloodsucking of the entire rest of the human race, from the &quot;safety&quot; of their tiny country, which is no bigger than New Jersey?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I think the answer is obvious. The Jewish mantra, &quot;Never Again,&quot; is a vain hope. As surely as the sun rises, there will be another Jewish Holocaust, perhaps worse than the last.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Regretfully yours,&lt;BR/&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/3167262380663642924'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/3167262380663642924'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231387980000#c3167262380663642924' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 7, 2009 at 9:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7217543259861269169</id><published>2009-01-07T17:07:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-07T17:07:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>LemeulYou make good points however you destroy you...</title><content type='html'>Lemeul&lt;BR/&gt;You make good points however you destroy your message with stupid racist statements and jokes. As the good book says &quot;the heart of man is desperately evil and wicked - who  can know it&quot;. No matter skin color, nationality or ethnicity in the heart of every man beats the desire to be a tyrant. It is only God&#39;s common grace that restrains.It is only His saving grace that redeems and makes whole. &lt;BR/&gt;Stuart</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/7217543259861269169'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/7217543259861269169'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231373220000#c7217543259861269169' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 7, 2009 at 5:07 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-292497119111457384</id><published>2009-01-07T13:46:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-07T13:46:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>On the matter of Arab Christians in the PA -- how ...</title><content type='html'>&lt;I&gt;On the matter of Arab Christians in the PA -- how are they faring in Gaza?&lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The Palestinian Christian population of Gaza, while not absolutely zero, probably comprises less than one percent of that territory&#39;s population.  Gaza Palestinians have always overwhelmingly been Sunni Muslims, which explains the particular resilience of Hamas in that part of the Palestinian territories.  Most of the Palestinian Christian population (or what now remains of it) is concentrated in East Jerusalem and in scattered localities on the West Bank.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;[Hebrew Character]&#39;s point about the state of Arabs within Israel proper is generally true, although I would not go so far as to say that any Arab community within Israel is &quot;flourishing.&quot;  &quot;Surviving&quot; is more accurate.  &quot;Israeli Arabs&quot; and  &quot;Palestinians&quot; are, in fact, the same people.  It&#39;s merely a question of within which national boundaries they find themselves residing.  Indeed, many Palestinians have extended family members who live (and have for centuries always lived) within what is now Israel proper, and vice versa, a plight that has caused no end of despair and tragedy for many of the regions Arabs since 1948.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/292497119111457384'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/292497119111457384'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231361160000#c292497119111457384' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 7, 2009 at 1:46 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-492146472243160701</id><published>2009-01-07T12:05:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-07T12:05:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>John Polomny said: &quot;I find it ironic that Israeli ...</title><content type='html'>John Polomny said: &quot;I find it ironic that Israeli politics is dominated by Askenazi Jews whose parents or grandparents immigrated to Israel ie. Ehud Barak (Poland), Tzipi Livini (Poland), Benjamin Netanyahu (Lithuania). So we have a situation of non-semites killing semites?&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Exactly. Most of the world does not know that the Ashkenazic Jews originated, not in the Middle East, but in Eastern Europe, when the king of the Khazarian tribes converted to Judaism along with his people around 800 AD. They were a red-haired, watery-eyed Turkic-Mongol race renowned for their aggressiveness, warmongering, avarice, cruelty, lying, stealing, and plundering. They were feared and hated by everyone with whom they interacted. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.khazaria.com/&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And now, these are the rulers of Israel. Their homeland is somehwere around Nizhny Novgorod. Palestine was never their homeland, unlike the Sephardic Jews, a cultured and gentle race like the Arabs who are their blood brothers. The Ashkenazim claiming &quot;Israel&quot; as their homeleand would be akin to me saying, &quot;Hail Wakantanka&quot; and then claiming a share in Native American casino revenues and  a free home on the reservation because &quot;I am now an Indian.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Let us do some simple yet significant arithmetic: In 1948 the Jewish population of the West Bank and the other territories which were occupied by Israel in 1967 was 2,810. Today it is 484,562 (Source: Wikipedia). That represents, let us say, 200,000 Jewish homes built on land stolen for nothing from Arabs since 1967 and sold for good money to Jewish immigrants. 200,000 houses at an average of $150,000 each represents $30,000,000,000 (30 BILLION U.S. dollars).&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Once again, the whole issue of Israeli territorial expansionism is all about money. The Jewish State is a massive criminal money-making enterprise by a small mafia of immensely rich men.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Question: Why do Jews have such big noses? Answer: Air is free.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;(However, let us be fair. Many of our greatest cultural achievements in America we owe to Jews. For example, the Grand Canyon. Darwinists maintain it was formed over millions of years. Creationists maintain God made it in six days. Actually, what happened was that Myron Finkelstein lost a quarter down a gopher hole in Arizona.)&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Yours sincerely,&lt;BR/&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/492146472243160701'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/492146472243160701'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231355100000#c492146472243160701' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 7, 2009 at 12:05 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8163690763882467108</id><published>2009-01-07T00:53:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-07T00:53:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>[Hebrew Characters] -- I appreciate both your kind...</title><content type='html'>[Hebrew Characters] -- I appreciate both your kind comments and the cogent way in which you phrased your points of disagreement, to which I will respond in order.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;1), 2), and 3) -- I agree that &quot;aid&quot; from Washington to Israel does not benefit the Israelis. I think there&#39;s merit to the idea that Israel is a vassal of Washington (which is how certain officials and deals are &quot;imposed&quot; on Israel) but there is likewise merit to the idea that the relationship between Anglo-American and Israeli power elites is one of mutually harmful co-dependence. To be candid, I&#39;m still trying to figure this out, as are people much more astute than myself.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;4) Not being a nationalist, I&#39;m not sure how to address the question of the &quot;artificiality&quot; of the Palestinians. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Where the question of dispossessing Arab inhabitants of Palestine (however one designates them) is concerned, I don&#39;t subscribe to the idea that property rights are a function of group identity.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;On the matter of Arab Christians in the PA -- how are they faring in Gaza? &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;5) We are &lt;I&gt;&lt;B&gt;heartily&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/I&gt; in agreement here. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;On that point: I was mortified to learn -- during a law enforcement seminar on terrorism at the University of Illinois/Chicago (yes, the same school that boasts William Ayers on its faculty) in 1997 about the assistance given by our ATF to Yasser Arafat&#39;s secret police organs, of which he had a half-dozen or more. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;6) I am aware of the fact that there is a deeply religious strain of Zionism that has little to do with the secular 19th Century movement,and I acknowledged as much in the essay. But it&#39;s of interest to me that the founding cadres of the State of Israel went out of their way to establish that country as a secular socialist regime officially hostile to religious Judaism. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;7) In an earlier version of this essay I included some material about the Gaza disengagement, which is something I&#39;ve written about before and will probably address again on another occasion. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In that draft I also made reference to Ben Hecht&#39;s book &lt;I&gt;Perfidy&lt;/I&gt;, which reveals just how deeply cynical and corrupt the Israeli State has always been, and how its ruling elite -- the supposed guardian of the Jewish people -- have been willing to betray and sacrifice those people in pursuit of their own interests. Once again, that&#39;s a subject I&#39;ve discussed before and will probably write about again.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/8163690763882467108'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/8163690763882467108'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231314780000#c8163690763882467108' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/SJvC4fevJoI/AAAAAAAADAY/kAbZoDrn1qI/s1600-R/Grigg(2).jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 7, 2009 at 12:53 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3323226456512479270</id><published>2009-01-07T00:25:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-07T00:25:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I generally find your blog very informative, but I...</title><content type='html'>I generally find your blog very informative, but I disagree with most of your points here.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;in random order:&lt;BR/&gt;1) The US funding to Israel is not to help Israel, but to control it.&lt;BR/&gt;As the result of its influence, the US is able to nullify arm deals worth much more than the aid itself.&lt;BR/&gt;Recall that Congressman Ron Paul said this during his campaign.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;2) Israel is a vassal state of the US, completely controlled by the US state department. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;3) The governor of the Bank of Israel is Stanley Fischer, of Citibank, IMF, World Bank, need I say more ... he is not Israeli, he was imposed on Israel.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;4) The Palestinians are an artificial people, they are just Arabs. Most &amp;quot;Palestinians&amp;quot; came to Israel during the British Mandate, while the British returned Jews to Nazi Europe, they allowed free Arab immigration.&lt;BR/&gt;BTW, the Christians are all fleeing Bethlehem which is under Palestinian rule, but the Arab Christians in Israel are flourishing.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;5) The CIA and the EU &amp;amp; the Israeli government fund the terrorist Palestinian Authority.&lt;BR/&gt;The conflict is a dialectic process to bring about a new middle east, cf. Sarkozy&amp;#39;s plan for a Mediterranean Union.&lt;BR/&gt;see Lord Milner quoted in Dr. Carol Quigley&amp;#39;s book on the Anglo-American elite, that there should not be a Jewish state but a middle-east federation.&lt;BR/&gt;See Dr. Dennis Cuddy&amp;#39;s articles on newswithviews.com about how wars are used by the power elite to bring &amp;quot;order out of chaos.&amp;quot;&lt;BR/&gt;Also see Dr. Eugene Narrett&amp;#39;s latest article on israelendtimes.com about Gaza&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;6) The Zionist movement was originally started by the Gaon of Vilna &amp;amp; Chasidic Rabbis in the late 1700&amp;#39;s, not by secular Jews.&lt;BR/&gt;Jews have always longed to return to the land of Israel &amp;amp; have prayed for it for 2000 years.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;7) What about the Gaza disengagement, why would the Israeli gov&amp;#39;t give up land and expel its own citizens ?&lt;BR/&gt;Why, because it is a puppet regime.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/3323226456512479270'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/3323226456512479270'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231313100000#c3323226456512479270' title=''/><author><name>דן</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01727936251574093248</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-922373818"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 7, 2009 at 12:25 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6597583865873949976</id><published>2009-01-06T23:46:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-06T23:46:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, I thoroughly enjoy your blog, and I have lea...</title><content type='html'>Will, I thoroughly enjoy your blog, and I have learned much from it.  I respectfully disagree with your view of Religious Judaism.  The author of &quot;Productive Christians in an Age of Guilt Manipulators,&quot; David Chilton, succinctly summarized it when he wrote that the god of Orthodox Judaism is Satan.  I know it sounds extreme, but Orthodox Judaism (or Reform or Conservative Judaism for that matter) is not about the Old Testament God or the Old Testament.  Rather, it is about self-worship, racism and the Talmud and/or Kabbalah.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;On the subject of the atrocities in Gaza, much light is shed on Israel&#39;s response by Rabbi Martin Antelman&#39;s book, &quot;To Eliminate the Opiate, Vol 2&quot; (Vol. 1 used to be sold by the Birch Society&#39;s AO Bookstore).  On page 221 Antelman writes, concerning his support of the decision to use the atomic bomb against Hiroshima and Nagasaki, &quot;For Jewish law equates life for life, and does not differentiate between a civilian and a soldier.&quot;  It doesn&#39;t matter to the IDF if they are attacking Hamas, or a Palestinian civilian--it&#39;s all good to them.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Antenlman&#39;s first book is worth reading for information about secret societies, but one does have to suffer Antelman&#39;s ego, which is substantial--as one would expect from someone who worships himself.  I haven&#39;t finished his second book yet.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Two good sources written by Trinitarian Christians about the Satanic religion of Judaism is Michael Hoffman&#39;s &quot;Judaism Discovered&quot; (almost exclusively about Orthodox Judaism) and Elizabeth Dilling&#39;s commentary on the Talmud, which may be found at www.come-and-hear.com/dilling/index.html.  Michael Hoffman lives in Idaho, btw.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Also pertinent to the discussion of Gaza, Hoffman details starting on page 438 of his tome, the Talmud&#39;s advocacy of genocide.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;It goes without saying that the culture of Judaism reflects its evil religious inspiration.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Keep up the good work.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And yes, J.R. Rothdoony is a pen name.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/6597583865873949976'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/6597583865873949976'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231310760000#c6597583865873949976' title=''/><author><name>J.R. Rothdoony</name><uri>http://www.statelesschristianity.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 6, 2009 at 11:46 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6492516916300954832</id><published>2009-01-06T20:10:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-06T20:10:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Palestinians, Jews and Americans need to collectiv...</title><content type='html'>&lt;I&gt;Palestinians, Jews and Americans need to collectively unite against the Elite forces of evil that wish their demise.&lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Boy, this earns an emphatic &quot;Amen!&quot; from me.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/6492516916300954832'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7570461305992287187/comments/default/6492516916300954832'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html?showComment=1231297800000#c6492516916300954832' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/SJvC4fevJoI/AAAAAAAADAY/kAbZoDrn1qI/s1600-R/Grigg(2).jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/01/bubble-of-us-israeli-dominance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7570461305992287187' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7570461305992287187' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-134401